      "y": 2997,
      "name": "13-14 / Bright watermelon real estate / START HERE",
      "context": "Design read: local real estate for buyers and sellers, playful watermelon branding. Design variance 8, motion intensity 3, visual density 4. Native editable pen concepts, preserving brokerage navigation and New Listings. Light theme requested through bright colors. Brand palette overrides single-accent default. Shape system: pill buttons, 16px cards and inputs, large curves only for watermelon rind imagery. Generated home photography is concept-only. Responsive handoff: below 768px collapse page rows to one column, controls wrap in two rows, cards stack, decorative seeds avoid text, mascot stays <=120px. Motion, runtime states, Lighthouse and dual runtime themes are implementation checks outside these static boards.",
